@@ -0,0 +1,499 @@
+# Hy3: vendored from nki-library (2026-10-19) experimental/deepseek_v32/deepseek_v3_router, imports made absolute.
+# Hy3 routing = DeepSeek-V3 noaux_tc with n_group=1, topk_group=1 (sigmoid, selection-only bias, L1 norm, x2.826).
+# Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates. All Rights Reserved.
+#
